  "description": "The Driggs 8i Disc is Brooklyn Bicycle Co.'s premium commuter bike, built for riders who want a clean look and minimal upkeep. A Shimano Nexus 8-speed internal hub keeps all the gearing mechanics sealed inside the rear hub, so there is no exposed derailleur to snag, adjust, or clean. Hydraulic disc brakes deliver powerful, consistent stopping in rain, snow, or dry conditions. The lightweight aluminum frame features a refined geometry that puts you upright enough to see traffic and relaxed enough to ride all day. Integrated fenders come standard. Puncture-resistant tires and a chain guard round out a package designed to keep your clothes clean and your wheels turning. If you want a bike that works as hard as you do without asking for constant attention, the Driggs is it.",
